       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUMOFSQUARES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 I PIC 9(3).
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
               COMPUTE TOTAL = TOTAL + I * I
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
